    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "That's a strong starting point. I'm seeing a lot of pushback from fiscal conservatives who say it's just a massive waste of money or that it'll destroy any remaining incentive to work. How would you address those critics? Are their arguments actually valid, or are they just ignoring the reality of what's coming?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
